Description: palOS icon theme: folders, drives, trash and the palOS logo
 Blue paper folders (Documents, Downloads, Music, Pictures, Videos and the
 rest), silver system drives, yellow USB drives, green backup drives, purple
 network drives and a wooden wastebasket for the Trash. Every other icon comes
 from Yaru. Also installs the palOS shield logo, the palOS Store and installer
 icons.
